    {
      "text": "City page: about 85 ft tall, FAR 4.10, 168 short-term and 17 long-term bike spaces, 10,764 sq ft of open space (4,670 sq ft publicly accessible); demolishes a 10,361 sq ft single-story commercial building. The 14 BMR units cover 10 for the 15% inclusionary requirement, 3 for the community amenity requirement and 1 moderate-income unit under State Density Bonus Law. Approvals: use permit for bonus-level development, architectural control, BMR housing agreement.",
